{"id":"644923","name":"凉拌鱼皮青瓜腐竹","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/644923/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鱼皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青瓜","amount":"一条"},{"name":"腐竹","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备:泡软的腐竹。","img":"images/644923/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"蒜头，香菜，青瓜。","img":"images/644923/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"辣味鱼皮。","img":"images/644923/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"花生米。","img":"images/644923/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将青瓜削掉部分皮改刀切块，香菜切碎，剁点蒜末放入大碗里。","img":"images/644923/step_5.jpeg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将腐竹煮三分钟捞出来沥水备用。","img":"images/644923/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"将腐竹，鱼皮也放入大碗里，调香油，香醋，酱油，辣椒油，糖，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/644923/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/644923/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入花生米，上桌品尝啦。","img":"images/644923/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/644923/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/644923/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}